{"schemaVersion":2,"root":{"fen":"rnbakabnr/9/1c5c1/p1p1p1p1p/9/9/P1P1P1P1P/1C5C1/9/RNBAKABNR w - - 0 1","comment":"　　 本局棋以近期流行的激烈开局拉开序幕，平时注重布局研究的徐天红对此阵的解拆更为透彻深入，结果陶汉明误中对手“家庭作业”的埋伏而致速败。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h2e2","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h9g7","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h0g2","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"i9h9","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"i0h0","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b9c7","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"c3c4","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g6g5","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h0h6","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h7i7","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h6g6","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"i7i8","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"e3e4","comment":"　　 平时极少采用流行套路的陶特大忽然心血来潮走起了急冲中兵的定式，显然是出于抢分的目的。另外还有马八进七、炮八平六、马八进九等选择，均有复杂的变化。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"d9e8","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"e4e5","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"i8g8","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g6f6","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g5g4","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g2e3","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h9h1","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b0c2","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g7h5","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"f6g6","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h5g7","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g6f6","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g7h5","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"f6g6","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h5g7","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g6f6","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g4g3","comment":"　　 黑方连续用马捉车试探对方的应手，再以卒吃兵，着法老练。局面至此已形成近期较为流行的布局定式，战斗一触即发……","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"e3d5","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"c9e7","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"d5c7","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"a9c9","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"c7e6","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"c9d9","comment":"　　 黑方平车肋道耐人寻味，以往多走卒3进1，红方以下有兵七进一和马七退五两种选择，均有复杂激烈的攻防变化。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"f0e1","comment":"　　 补仕是防黑方马7进8的反击手段，当然也可改走炮五平六（意在联相），黑则马7进5，相七进五，车8平3，车九平七，炮7进8，仕四进五，车3进1，相五退七，马5退3，炮六进四，炮2进4，兵一进一，形成红方子力位置稍佳，黑方多得一相，互有顾忌的局面。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h1h0","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b2a2","comment":"　　 如图形势，红方分炮意在迅速出动左车抢攻，但对黑方潜在的攻击力量缺乏清醒的认识。应改走炮五平四，黑方如接走马7进8（如马7进5，相七进五，红优），车四平三，车8平7，炮四退二，炮7平9，形成红方多子，黑方占势的两分局面。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g7h5","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"f6g6","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h5f4","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g6g8","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h0g0","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"e1f0","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b7b8","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g8g7","comment":"　　 徐天红再弃一炮显得胸有成竹。实战中曾出现走车三退三的下法，以下象5进7？兵五平四！马6进5，炮九平五，车4进8，车九平八，炮2进7，马五进七，象7退5，后马进五，红方攻势如潮，结果获胜。后来棋手们发现红方车三退三时，黑不急于走象5进7吃车而改走马6进4叫杀，结果黑方仍占先机。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"f4g2","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"e2f2","comment":"　　 如改走仕六进五，黑则车4进8（下伏车4平5大胆穿心的杀棋，红方难应），接下来的变化与实战殊途同归。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"d9d1","comment":"　　 进车催杀，着法凶悍！","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"d0e1","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g2f0","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"f2f1","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g0i0","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"c2e3","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"d1d3","comment":"　　 黑胜。红如接走仕五退四吃马，黑则车9平6弃车伏杀。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}}